{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458370/extras/dc6f015569e38ee4dc257cf779756413.avif?t=1769591131\" width=1438 height=807 /></span>As the Zankoi, you are both a weapon and a mystery. Your journey will take you through haunting memories of a war-torn world, each one revealing fragments of your past. With every battle won, you grow closer to uncovering the truth behind the war\u2014and your role in it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458370/extras/1d94b9a31b86b90480718774844a6b67.avif?t=1769591131\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458370/extras_big/1d94b9a31b86b90480718774844a6b67.avif?t=1769591131 width=800 height=197 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zankoi's Chronicles is a unique action deckbuilding game that blends real-time combat with strategic card play. Build your deck, customize your abilities, and unleash devastating combos to overcome powerful foes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game\u2019s combat is divided into two dynamic phases: Fighting Mode and Card Playing Mode, with the Poise Gauge serving as the key to shifting between them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighting Mode: Engage in fast-paced, real-time combat to deplete your opponent\u2019s Poise Gauge. Use your basic attacks, defenses, and combat abilities to wear them down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458370/extras/e1208e6fe4dc6331635ee7f37421d6d5.poster.avif?t=1769591131\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458370/extras/e1208e6fe4dc6331635ee7f37421d6d5.webm?t=1769591131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458370/extras/e1208e6fe4dc6331635ee7f37421d6d5.mp4?t=1769591131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card Playing Mode: Once the Poise Gauge is broken, the battle shifts into a strategic card-playing phase. Play your carefully crafted combo cards to unleash powerful, high-damage attacks and turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458370/extras/5899d725655dd2adb9b509ed4eec4f35.poster.avif?t=1769591131\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458370/extras/5899d725655dd2adb9b509ed4eec4f35.webm?t=1769591131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458370/extras/5899d725655dd2adb9b509ed4eec4f35.mp4?t=1769591131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458370/extras/bf7ae9c81560c25c948817d0be8d9200.avif?t=1769591131\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458370/extras_big/bf7ae9c81560c25c948817d0be8d9200.avif?t=1769591131 width=800 height=197 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458370/extras/5bce2488076614e6f09f03783bcd185e.poster.avif?t=1769591131\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458370/extras/5bce2488076614e6f09f03783bcd185e.webm?t=1769591131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458370/extras/5bce2488076614e6f09f03783bcd185e.mp4?t=1769591131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Combat and Combo System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of combat by breaking your opponent\u2019s Poise Gauge and entering Combo Time. Chain together powerful combo moves for massive damage, with some combos dealing triple the impact!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458370/extras/530fd8810d23263b1f41909e56c000a0.poster.avif?t=1769591131\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458370/extras/530fd8810d23263b1f41909e56c000a0.webm?t=1769591131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458370/extras/530fd8810d23263b1f41909e56c000a0.mp4?t=1769591131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Deck, Forge Your Playstyle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and customize a wide variety of cards to create a deck that suits your strategy. Assign cards to either Fighting Mode or Card Playing Mode, and experiment with synergies to maximize their effectiveness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458370/extras/be70f9a4bba9206033dbc352efddc994.poster.avif?t=1769591131\" width=574 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458370/extras/be70f9a4bba9206033dbc352efddc994.webm?t=1769591131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458370/extras/be70f9a4bba9206033dbc352efddc994.mp4?t=1769591131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blessings: Power Up Your Deck</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover Blessings, powerful passive enhancements that enhance specific cards or mechanics. Build your deck around these blessings to unlock devastating combos and dominate your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458370/extras/4eb2ec6c1c853cfbe804bdef7d31e25b.poster.avif?t=1769591131\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458370/extras/4eb2ec6c1c853cfbe804bdef7d31e25b.webm?t=1769591131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458370/extras/4eb2ec6c1c853cfbe804bdef7d31e25b.mp4?t=1769591131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Temple System: Upgrade and Adapt</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend coins in the Temple to upgrade cards, delete unwanted ones, or exchange them for new options. Continuously refine your deck to stay ahead of increasingly challenging foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458370/extras/90584e995f2dd15fad2dde46918b7ca2.poster.avif?t=1769591131\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458370/extras/90584e995f2dd15fad2dde46918b7ca2.webm?t=1769591131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458370/extras/90584e995f2dd15fad2dde46918b7ca2.mp4?t=1769591131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Legacy Progression: Grow Stronger with Each Run</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you succeed or fail, your journey leaves a lasting impact. Retain key cards from each run to strengthen your starting deck in future attempts. At higher difficulties, even card upgrades carry over, giving you an edge against tougher challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458370/extras/80f2b8f0e8308918b4a9e0d2211cdd01.poster.avif?t=1769591131\" width=584 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458370/extras/80f2b8f0e8308918b4a9e0d2211cdd01.webm?t=1769591131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458370/extras/80f2b8f0e8308918b4a9e0d2211cdd01.mp4?t=1769591131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Talent Tree: Customize Your Soulforged</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a unique talent tree to permanently upgrade your character\u2019s health, poise, and attack power. Unlock special abilities and alter game mechanics to tilt the balance in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2458370?t=1769591131","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458370/71a9ffbd184035532b34a45283939a961a7202fd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769591131","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458370/8d341cf99aa5eb687807cf6f47d92738ef6cff90/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769591131","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2458370/8d341cf99aa5eb687807cf6f4